/**
 * @file transform
 * @brief Protocol-neutral, bounded HTTP request/response transformation.
 *
 * Wire adapters terminate HTTP/1.1, HTTP/2, or HTTP/3 and present one
 * semantic message model to this pipeline. The pipeline never exposes TLS
 * records, HPACK/QPACK state, frame lengths, or transport flow-control
 * authority to application policy.
 *
 * @copyright Copyright (c) 2022 NT Template Library Authors.
 */
